{
  "case": "14-unreadable-node",
  "contract": "LogicalUsageV1",
  "algorithm_version": 1,
  "description": "One node of one document will not read. The tolerant projection walk would log it and skip it.",
  "covers": [
    "D39",
    "D29"
  ],
  "input": {
    "account": "acct-1",
    "workspaces": [
      {
        "workspace": "ws-1",
        "state": "ENABLED",
        "counted": true,
        "documents": [
          {
            "document": "doc-1",
            "listing": {
              "kind": "page",
              "trashed_at": null
            },
            "durable": true,
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "n1",
                "parent": null,
                "ordinal": 0,
                "depth": 0,
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Quarterly plan",
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 14
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "n2",
                "parent": null,
                "ordinal": 1,
                "depth": 0,
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.",
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 44
                  }
                ],
                "read_error": "node content will not decode"
              }
            ],
            "state": "USAGE_UNKNOWN"
          },
          {
            "document": "doc-2",
            "listing": {
              "kind": "page",
              "trashed_at": null
            },
            "durable": true,
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "n1",
                "parent": null,
                "ordinal": 0,
                "depth": 0,
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Quarterly plan",
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 14
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "n2",
                "parent": null,
                "ordinal": 1,
                "depth": 0,
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.",
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "start": 0,
                    "end": 44
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "blobs": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "derivation": [
    "workspace ws-1 (ENABLED):",
    "  document doc-1: USAGE_UNKNOWN -> the document has no value; it propagates",
    "    doc-2/n1 (paragraph): node.text 14 = 14",
    "    doc-2/n2 (paragraph): node.text 44 = 44",
    "  document doc-2: 58",
    "  -> USAGE_UNKNOWN: the workspace component has no value",
    "account: USAGE_UNKNOWN propagates from an unknown workspace; the aggregate has no value"
  ],
  "expected": {
    "workspaces": [
      {
        "workspace": "ws-1",
        "workspace_state": "ENABLED",
        "counted": true,
        "usage_state": "USAGE_UNKNOWN",
        "documents_units": null,
        "files_bytes": null,
        "logical_usage_units": null,
        "algorithm_version": 1
      }
    ],
    "account": {
      "usage_state": "USAGE_UNKNOWN",
      "documents_units": null,
      "files_bytes": null,
      "logical_usage_units": null,
      "algorithm_version": 1
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "An unreadable node is unknown, not empty. Accounting cannot know that a node it could not read had no text — and with structure free, 'it probably cost nothing anyway' is exactly the reasoning D39 forbids.",
    "The forbidden answers are 14 for doc-1 (skipping the node the way walk::project does, which would make the workspace read 72), 58 (charging doc-1 its previous value), and any figure derived from stored blob bytes.",
    "doc-2's own value is still computable and is why the fault is diagnosable; the workspace and the account are nonetheless unknown, because a partial total is not a total.",
    "Effect: new durable receipts are refused with USAGE_UNKNOWN. Reads, downloads and restore are unaffected, and local editing never fails."
  ]
}
